    "invariants_acknowledged": [
      "OWNER RULINGS: R1 router in apps/api/src/modules/agent/ mounted beside agent; R2 never-downgrade is PG-199; Q1=B policies govern BOTH agent tool actions (AgentAction) and AI auto-response drafts; Q2=B enforce timeout, minimum reviewer role, auto-approve (default OFF) and escalation now, with a real executor, real confidence and an escalation scheduler; Q3=A minimum role on top of existing permission; Q4=B colorToken per policy with CHECK, TagsTab N/A.",
      "NO-ROWS INVARIANT: a tenant with no policy rows behaves exactly as today (agent actions 30 min, drafts 24 h, permission-only gates, no auto-approve, no escalation).",
      "AUTO-APPROVE GOVERNANCE: only when enabled, confidence finite in [0,1] and strictly above a 90..99 threshold (ISO 42001 D.1), impact present and not HIGH, not DELETE, not draft_message EMAIL/SMS, and the session requester could approve it themselves (min role + approve permission); audit-logged as system:approval-policy; DB errors fail closed.",
